         fix: rgit config --unset core.hooksPath (or create it)
error    .git/index.lock is 1 hour old: a command that crashed left it, and writes to it will fail
         fix: rgit doctor --fix (removes stale locks)
warning  .git/refs/heads/main.lock is recent (under 10 minutes old): a git or rgit command may still be running
         fix: wait for it; if nothing is running, delete .git/refs/heads/main.lock
